{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GOAL3 is an arcade soccer game where there are no prohibitions and rules! You will have to play fun and unpredictable matches on unique arenas, where nature itself will be the obstacle to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Tournament brings together the best national teams in the world - choose any of the 16 teams and fight for the Champions Cup. Or just play friendly matches - that's fun too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version of the game features only Friendly matches and two arenas with unique game mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STADION</strong> - Beware of lightning bolts, they are electrifying and very dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595970/extras/GOAL3_Stadium.gif.gif?t=1746478657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEACH</strong> - Tornadoes are a hoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595970/extras/GOAL3_Battlefield.gif.gif?t=1746478657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMMANDS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Argentina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Brazil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Cameroon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Croatia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- England</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- France</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Germany</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Holland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Italy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mexico</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Portugal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Russia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Senegal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ukraine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Orcs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Elves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Astronauts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Aliens</p><p clas